# Streaming datasets

Local: `{HVACPULSE_DATA_ROOT}/delta/<name>` via `Settings._delta_target`.
Unity Catalog: `{HVACPULSE_CATALOG}.{HVACPULSE_SCHEMA}.<name>`.

Air-handler: `bronze_telemetry`, `silver_telemetry_history`,
`silver_telemetry_current`, `quarantine_events`, `gold_hvac_metrics_current`,
`gold_hvac_metrics_history`, `gold_recommendations`, `recommendation_events`,
`late_corrections`, `metric_restatement_events`, `gold_data_quality_scorecard`,
`gold_sensor_freshness`, `gold_compliance`, `gold_equipment_health`,
`ops_pipeline_stage_runs`, `ops_dataset_publications`.

Plant: `silver_plant_snapshots`, `quarantine_plant_snapshots`,
`gold_plant_features`, `plant_model_registry`, `gold_plant_predictions`,
`gold_plant_control_decisions`.

Checkpoints, one query each: `bronze`, `silver`, `plant-silver`,
`plant-features`. Cloud root is `HVACPULSE_CHECKPOINT_ROOT` (ADLS or a UC
volume). Do not share a checkpoint, and do not run a stream and a drain on it
at once.

## Grain

- Bronze is append-only Kafka key, payload, and offset. No business-key upsert.
- Air-handler history key is `event_id`. Current is max `revision_number` per
  `logical_event_id`. Dedupe `(event_id, payload_hash)`; a different payload is
  `IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT`.
- Plant Silver identity is scope + capture time. Same payload is a retry;
  a different payload is quarantined. No silent restatement.
- Gold current is MERGE-upserted. History appends `metric_version`.
- Quarantine corrupt rows only. Alarming-but-valid rows stay in Silver
  (`quality/signals.py`).
- `spark.databricks.delta.schema.autoMerge.enabled` stays `false`. AQE stays on.
  Watermark default is `10 minutes`. Drains use `availableNow`; omit `--once`
  for a long-running stream.

Jobs: `bronze_ingest`, `silver_transform`, `gold_metrics`, `quality_metrics`,
`recommendations_job`, `reconciliation`, `maintenance`, `plant_silver`,
`plant_features`, `plant_learning`, `plant_pipeline`, `pipeline_health`.
Health policy lives in `reference/monitoring.yml`.
